    (property "Note" "Diverts most of the current to +5 V if the input goes high. R2 is what keeps the ADC inside its 10 mA limit. Mind the stripe: cathode (striped end) to +5V. Leakage 25 nA max adds up to 117 uV of offset through R2." (at 162.56 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
