  (text "R2 4.7 kΩ: limits the current into the ADC\n     if the input hits +/-12 V (2.4 mA max)\nCR1, CR2: clamp diodes, send an over-voltage to +5V or GND\nC1 100 nF: with R2 a 339 Hz low-pass filter against fast noise" (at 154.94 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "55ce3139-1e36-4272-acbc-eab740ddffea"))
  (text "J4 (ADS1115 inputs, not the UNO's): 1 = A1 preamp out, 2 = A2 (QPS read-back\nwhile JP1 is bridged), 3 = A3 VREF 2.5 V, 4 = GND.  Pins 1-3 are for a meter or scope only." (at 184.15 90.17 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1fa94729-c65d-45f6-8a77-a1869a02d23e"))
